  "id": "equipment-automation",
  "term": "equipment automation",
  "definition": "Equipment automation is the use of machines or automated systems to support or take over tasks that people would otherwise do by hand with tools, reagents, or instruments. In research settings, it is used to improve consistency, efficiency, safety, and movement toward clinical application, although it can also reduce flexibility and become outdated.",
